  hazardName: "Kesici-delici aletlerin ortada b\u0131rak\u0131lmas\u0131"
  description: "Sivri u\xE7lu, kesici ve delici malzemeleri kulland\u0131ktan sonra
    geli\u015Fig\xFCzel ortal\u0131kta b\u0131rakmamak hem \xE7al\u0131\u015Fanlar\u0131n
    yaralanma riskini azalt\u0131r hem de ofis i\xE7inde g\xFCvenli dola\u015F\u0131m
    alan\u0131 sa\u011Flar. Bu t\xFCr ekipmanlar\u0131n i\u015F bitiminde uygun yerine
    kald\u0131r\u0131lmas\u0131, d\xFCzenli ve kazas\u0131z bir \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma
    ortam\u0131n\u0131n olmazsa olmaz\u0131d\u0131r."
